id: autoplay-sound
section: Media and sound
item: Autoplay media with sound off (T-603, the Settings row; from the Atlas app): a page's own play() of a clip with its sound is refused, and a tap on the video starts it
shells: enyo
prefs: jihad.media.autoplayWithSound=false
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html?src=clip60av.webm&wide=1&sound=1
kit: cavekit-gre-widgets.md R1
wait rect v 20
calibrate 'sel:#status'
wait text status 'play refused' 10
shoot refused
tap v
wait text status playing 10
